51
00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:43.640
This is really an episode with just an A story.

52
00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:44.540
Yeah.

53
00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.860
Well, didn't start out that way.

54
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:47.800
We'll get to it.

55
00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.100
That is true.

56
00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:50.600
All right.

