59
00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.480
Oh, my gosh.

60
00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:02.640
Halfway through.

61
00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.120
Yeah.

62
00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:05.720
Halfway through.

63
00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.320
