time Aaron was born.

1179
00:56:01.320 --> 00:56:06.120
And maybe Phyllis might have some clues as to Aaron's origin story.

1180
00:56:06.340 --> 00:56:07.500
So they approach Phyllis.

1181
00:56:07.660 --> 00:56:08.820
Phyllis says she's sorry.

1182
00:56:08.980 --> 00:56:11.180
She can't remember anything and she can't help them.

1183
00:56:11.320 --> 00:56:15.980
But then she remembers, oh, wait, my mom videotaped my childbirth and I was at the

1184
